WHY AGPL HERE AND NOT ELSEWHERE

Code in this directory imports Ultralytics YOLO (AGPL-3.0). To avoid
ambiguity about combined-work status, everything that imports a detector
in-process lives here and is licensed AGPL-3.0-only.

Do not add non-detector code to this directory, and do not copy code from
here into scripts/. Shared helpers belong in scripts/ and are imported
upward. Cross-boundary invocation from scripts/ must use a subprocess call,
not an import.

Note that AGPL section 13 requires offering source to users who interact with
this software over a network. This repository is not network-facing; keep it
that way, or comply with section 13.
